---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Accessibility"
  description="Accessibility statement for the ACM IMX Steering Committee website."
>
  <div class="container page prose">
    <h1>Accessibility statement</h1>
    <p>
      We want everyone to be able to use this website. It aims to meet the Web Content Accessibility
      Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 at level AA.
    </p>
    <h2>What we do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Pages use clear headings, landmarks and a skip-to-content link.</li>
      <li>All functions work with a keyboard, and focus is clearly visible.</li>
      <li>Text and links meet WCAG AA colour contrast, and links are underlined.</li>
      <li>Images have text alternatives.</li>
      <li>The site works without JavaScript and at up to 400% zoom.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Known issues</h2>
    <p>
      Some linked documents (PDFs) and external sites, such as publisher pages, are outside our control and
      may not be fully accessible.
    </p>
    <h2>Feedback</h2>
    <p>
      If you find a problem or need information in a different format, email
      <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
